  "title": "William Shakespeare",
  "summary": "William Shakespeare was baptised in Stratford-upon-Avon on 26 April 1564; his birth date is unrecorded and 23 April is tradition. He appears in London records in 1592, was part-owner of the Lord Chamberlain's Men (later the King's Men) and co-financed the Globe, opened 1599. Credited with 38 plays, he left London for Stratford after 1613 and died on 23 April 1616, aged 52.",
